  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "BREAKING - needs TestFramework.Core 0.7.0. AddFileArtifact no longer takes removeParentDirectoryIfEmpty (use FileRef(path).RemoveParentDirectoryIfEmpty()), FileArtifactData.Data is gone (read Content), and steps are built only through LocalIOExt and UseRunDirectory; a second UseRunDirectory is refused while the run is planned. New: Exec and ExecIn start a program with no shell, so run values stay values; Cmd inserts them verbatim. Commands keep at most 1 MiB per stream, report what they wrote when they time out, and finish when they exit even if something they started still holds the output.",
